-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 4. §§7 & 10: Cubical face-filling
-- Given a learned cross-modal equivalence e : Equiv Visual Auditory (literacy) and a family of
-- continuations Cont : Type → Type, reading transports continuations along ua e, and tickertape
-- synesthesia (Hauw & Cohen 2023) is the exact inverse path sym (ua e).
fill-visual-to-auditory : {V A : Type} → (e : Equiv V A) → (Cont : Type → Type) →
  Cont V → Cont A
fill-visual-to-auditory e Cont cv = transport (λ i → Cont (ua e i)) cv
